---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span class="mono">SolutionXL — onafhankelijke consultancy · Diemen</span>
      <span class="mono current">Banking · Luchtvaart · Energie · Overheid · NGO</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-main">
      <h1 class="hero-head">
        Ik neem <span class="it">tijdelijk</span> over waar het <span class="it">écht</span> ingewikkeld wordt.
      </h1>

      <div class="hero-intro">
        <span class="mono hero-intro-label">Interim IT &amp; software leadership</span>
        <p class="hero-intro-lead">Meer richting. Sterkere teams. Voorspelbare delivery.</p>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          SolutionXL BV levert onafhankelijk interim IT- en softwaremanagement. Van Engineering Manager en Head of Engineering tot Software Delivery Lead en Product Lead: senior leiderschap voor teams die beter willen ontwikkelen, samenwerken en leveren.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-sector-note">Ervaring in banking, verzekeringen, luchtvaart, energie, mobiliteit en de publieke sector.</p>
        <a class="hero-explore" href="#expertise">Bekijk de expertise <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta" aria-label="Vervolgacties">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Plan een gesprek <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="#cases" class="btn-alt">Bekijk drie cases ↓</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <p class="quote">
        Hoe kan ik je helpen — waar heb je mij voor nodig?
        <span class="quote-src">— De vraag waarmee ik elke opdracht open</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem) clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); position: relative; }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    color: var(--muted);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .hero-meta .current { color: var(--ink-2); }

  .hero-main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: end;
    column-gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    row-gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
  }
  .hero-head { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .hero-intro { grid-column: 1; }
  .hero-cta { grid-column: 2; padding-bottom: 0.2rem; }

  .hero-head {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7.5vw, 9rem);
    max-width: 100%;
    text-wrap: balance;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero-head .it { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

  .hero-intro {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 72ch;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem) 0 0;
  }
  .hero-intro-label { color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-intro-lead {
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.8vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.18vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .hero-sector-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .hero-explore {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.7rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero-explore:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .hero-bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: none;
  }
  .quote::before {
    content: '"';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.5em;
    line-height: 0;
    vertical-align: -0.2em;
    margin-right: 0.1em;
  }
  .quote::after {
    content: '"';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.5em;
    line-height: 0;
    vertical-align: -0.4em;
  }

  .quote-src {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .hero-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .hero-head, .hero-intro, .hero-cta { grid-column: 1; }
    .hero-cta { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .hero-head { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 10vw, 6rem); }
    .hero-intro { max-width: 44rem; }
    .hero-bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .quote { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vw, 1.6rem); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 951px) {
    .quote { white-space: nowrap; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.85vw, 1.55rem); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .hero-cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .hero-cta a { text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
